---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';const p='/equipment/10-11/',src='https://www.mxwbio.com/products/maxone';
---
<Layout pageTitle="MaxOne passive site map" subtitle="" wide={true} description="Select ideal array coordinates and replay an inert synthetic electrical marker."><script is:inline>window.maxPassive=import('/equipment/10-11/array.mjs');</script><article class="equipment" id="mxpass"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/10-11/">← Equipment 10-11</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Register</a><a href="#mx-ref">References</a><a href="#mx-proof">Verification</a></nav><header class="eq-mast"><p class="eq-meta">10-11 / PASSIVE ELECTRICAL REPLAY</p><h2>Find the one site you didn’t route.</h2><p class="eq-lede">A fixed synthetic electrical marker sits at row 74, column 146. Replay without it: the site is masked. Route it and replay again to recover its 120 µV peak at the same coordinate.</p></header>
<div class="cols"><section><p class="eq-meta">01 / HARDWARE REFERENCE</p><h3>MaxWell MaxOne with empty PSM ring</h3><div id="mx-view" aria-label="Metric MaxOne hub, recording unit and empty chip"></div><small id="mx-model" role="status">Loading metric model…</small><div class="tools"><button id="mx-all">Whole system</button><button id="mx-chip">Sensing area</button><button id="mx-rear">Rear I/O</button><button id="mx-mount">Remove empty chip</button></div><p>Orbit and zoom. Click a point on the close-up rectangular sensor or the larger plan map to focus. Click the ring to remove the empty display chip. The visual unit does not transmit commands.</p></section>
<section><p class="eq-meta">02 / LOGICAL ROUTES</p><h3>Select ideal coordinates</h3><div class="fields"><label>Row (0–119)<input id="mx-row" type="number" step="1" min="0" max="119" value="74"/></label><label>Column (0–219)<input id="mx-col" type="number" step="1" min="0" max="219" value="146"/></label></div><div class="tools"><button id="mx-toggle">Route focused site</button><button id="mx-ref">Route reference site</button><button id="mx-run" class="run">Replay selected routes</button><button id="mx-reset">Reset example</button></div><p id="mx-route-count"></p><p id="mx-status" role="status">Default selects two neighboring sites.</p><details><summary>Check the route budget</summary><div class="tools"><button id="mx-full-limit">Set 1,020</button><button id="mx-limit">Try 1,021</button></div><p>Only a total count is tested. Real hardware routing restrictions are not reproduced.</p></details></section></div>
<section><p class="eq-meta">03 / PASSIVE REPLAY</p><h3>Sampled zero is not an unsampled site</h3><p id="mx-focus" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="cols"><canvas id="mx-map" width="640" height="365" aria-label="Coordinate picker and masked MaxOne ideal map"></canvas><canvas id="mx-plot" width="640" height="150" aria-label="Focused synthetic electrical waveform"></canvas></div><div class="tools"><button id="mx-save" disabled>Export masked map and routed traces</button><button id="mx-wave" disabled>Export focused voltage channel</button><a href={p+'example-waveform.json'}>Example waveform</a></div></section>
<section id="mx-ref"><p class="eq-meta">04 / DOCUMENTED CONFIGURATION</p><h3>Metric system and ideal grid</h3><p>The <a href={src}>manufacturer’s system photographs and specification tables</a> give a 185 × 280 × 90 mm hub and a 150 × 95 × 25 mm recording unit (L × W × H). The illustrated empty MaxOne+ PSM ring is 24 mm outer, 19 mm inner and 8 mm high. The 3.85 × 2.10 mm sensing area, 17.5 µm pitch, 26,400 sites, 1,020 recorded routes and 20 kHz per channel inform this model; connectors, shortened cable, carrier details and colors are illustrative. No vendor images republished.</p><div class="tools"><a href={p+'build-model.py'} download>Editable source</a><a href={p+'maxone.glb'} download>Download GLB</a><a href={p+'xr.json'}>Geometry and VR targets</a><a href={p+'array.mjs'}>Coordinate and replay module</a></div></section>
<section id="mx-proof"><p class="eq-meta">05 / VERIFICATION</p><h3>Fixed point, exact count</h3><p>The illustrative rectangular 220 × 120 grid has 17.5 µm pitch and cell-centred coordinates. Independently, row 74 and column 146 imply +638.75 µm and +253.75 µm from centre. The single fixed Gaussian voltage fixture peaks at sample 80 (4 ms) and 120 µV. The exact route count and coordinate were verified; 1,021 routes is rejected; unselected sites stay JSON null, not 0 V. No source spreading, noise, tissue, stimulation, physical electronics or vendor switch-matrix behavior is modeled.</p><p>Outputs <code>bts.maxone-passive-map.v1</code> and a compatible single-route <code>bts.analog-waveform.v1</code> keep ideal site and logical route IDs, sample ID, revision and explicit volts/seconds. Web orbit and pointer controls are verified separately from a physical VR headset; geometry and actions are reusable.</p></section>
</article></Layout><script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/10-11/client.mjs';</script><style is:global>
#mxpass .cols,#mxpass .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.14fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:.8rem}#mxpass section{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem;margin:.8rem 0;min-width:0}#mxpass .cols section{margin:0}#mxpass .eq-meta{margin:0}#mxpass h3{margin:.3rem 0 .63rem;font-size:1.5rem}#mxpass .tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;margin:.65rem 0}#mxpass label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}#mxpass button,#mxpass input{min-height:40px;padding:.37rem;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--panel,transparent);color:var(--text)}#mxpass button{cursor:pointer}#mxpass button.run{background:#335d55;color:white}#mxpass button:disabled{opacity:.5}#mx-view{height:clamp(260px,31vw,410px);background:#263437}#mx-view canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}#mx-plot,#mx-map{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}#mx-map{cursor:crosshair}#mx-focus{font-weight:bold}#mxpass code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:760px){#mxpass .cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}#mxpass section{padding:.68rem}}
</style>
